  m_text: "Your Spaceship AH7188 has suffered a critical system failure. \nThe control
    circuits and repair cables are severely damaged.\n\nTo bring the ship back online,
    you must repair each broken component by learning and applying Boolean Logic.\n\nEach
    level introduces minimum 1 logical operation. Repair the first cable, restore
    the first system, and continue until all 6 spaceship components are working again."
